{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>And you shall say to my lord, to Esau.</b> He commanded that the messenger not present himself as one who knows Esau and is sent to him — lest Esau think that his brother knew he was coming to meet him and sent him a gift out of fear. Rather, let the messenger present himself as one sent to Seir and as not knowing Esau."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:32:59.058723894Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}